        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Mel Gibson, Benedict Fitzgerald, Jim Caviezel, Maia Morgenstern, Monica Bellucci, Jan Kounen, Tchéky Karyo, Vincent Cassel\n- Films: The Passion of the Christ, The Matrix Reloaded, The Matrix Revolutions, Malèna, Irréversible, Dobermann\n- Roles: Jesus Christ, Virgin Mary, Mary Magdalene, Persephone, Malèna Scordia, Alex\n\nFacts:\n- Monica Bellucci starred in the 1997 French film Dobermann, which was directed by Jan Kounen and also starred Tchéky Karyo and Vincent Cassel.\n- Monica Bellucci played Malèna Scordia in the 2000 film Malèna.\n- Monica Bellucci played Persephone in the 2003 science-fiction films The Matrix Reloaded and The Matrix Revolutions.\n- The Passion of the Christ is a 2004 American biblical drama film directed by Mel Gibson and written by Mel Gibson and Benedict Fitzgerald.\n- The Passion of the Christ stars Jim Caviezel as Jesus Christ, Maia Morgenstern as the Virgin Mary, and Monica Bellucci as Mary Magdalene.\n- Monica Bellucci played Alex in the controversial art film Irréversible.",
